{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57814","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57814","key":"SV-11321","fields":{"summary":"Tech View: column header labels 12px, weight 500, secondary color; no overlap","description":"h3. What\n\nRestyle Tech View's column header labels to the design and stop labels colliding.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS2-R21: \"Tech View's column header labels are 12px, medium weight (500), in the secondary text color, as in the design. Labels never overlap a neighboring label.\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v51|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S2-R21).\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nLabels are bold black. At 1440px \"Lead Technician\" runs into \"Clocked In\", and \"Progress\" touches \"Service Advisor\".\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Header labels match the design's style at 1440 and 1536 wide.\n* No label touches or overlaps its neighbor, with the default columns and with every optional column added.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\n----\n\n*Test cases for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590113|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590113] Tech View opens on 13 default columns with small grey header labels\n* [C590126|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590126] No labels overlap in the toolbar and headers from 1024 to 1920 px wide","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57814/comment/78734","id":"78734","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-manageme